tainer></p>\n<p>What is the eighth number in the sequence?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:13 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:18</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
